Declare small as unsigned character.
Declare wide as long integer.
Declare overflowed as integer.
Set overflowed to Checked add 200 and 100 into small.
Say overflowed.
Say small.
Set overflowed to Checked subtract 0 and 1 into small.
Say overflowed.
Say small.
Set overflowed to Checked multiply 3000000000 and 4 into wide.
Say overflowed.
Say wide.
Set overflowed to Checked multiply 3000000000 and 4000000000 into wide.
Say overflowed.
